%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a996e19c4d83684a905dbed745d44a8, type: 3}
  m_Name: SOCutscene_Feed_Enter
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIandCinematic.SOCutscene
  _endBlendSeconds: 1
  _steps:
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "도착! 여기가 피드 앱 안이야. 게시물들이 여기저기 떠다니고 있지?"
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 1
    SpeakerName:
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message:
    CameraShot: {fileID: 11400000, guid: eb657459483c3d14b9a227696c1d62a4, type: 2}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey: Feed_PillarTop
    Message: "저기 꼭대기까지 올라가면서 게시물에 필요한 재료를 모으면 돼."
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey: Feed_DecoyFeed
    Message: "저 빨간 피드들은 악성 미끼 피드야. 거짓 정보나 과장된 내용으로 사람들을 속이는 게시물이지."
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey: Feed_DecoyFeed
    Message: "재료를 가로막고 있으니까 제거하고 재료를 먹고 지나가면 돼."
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uCF54\uB9AC"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "그러니까 제목, 사진, 음악, 내용, 해시태그... 다섯 개를 모으면 되는 거지?"
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
  - Type: 0
    SpeakerName: "\uBE44\uD2B8"
    Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    CameraKey:
    Message: "응. 다 모으고 업로드하면 게시물이 완성되는 거지. 일단 올라가 봐."
    CameraShot: {fileID: 0}
